<span begin="0:42.847" end="0:43.212">今</span><span begin="0:43.212" end="0:43.464">か</span><span begin="0:43.464" end="0:43.596">ら</span><span begin="0:43.596" end="0:43.728">あ</span><span begin="0:43.728" end="0:44.160">そ</span><span begin="0:44.160" end="0:44.805">ぼ</span></p><p begin="0:45.249" end="0:49.261" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.249" end="0:45.411">そ</span><span begin="0:45.411" end="0:45.573">ん</span><span begin="0:45.573" end="0:45.921">な</span><span begin="0:45.921" end="0:46.329">仲</span><span begin="0:46.329" end="0:46.681">で</span><span begin="0:46.681" end="0:46.861">も</span><span begin="0:46.861" end="0:47.009">な</span><span begin="0:47.009" end="0:47.161">い</span><span begin="0:47.161" end="0:47.345">け</span><span begin="0:47.345" end="0:48.229">ど</span><span begin="0:48.229" end="0:49.261">?</span></p><p begin="0:49.993" end="0:54.073" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.993" end="0:50.089">ど</span><span begin="0:50.089" end="0:50.185">う</span><span begin="0:50.185" end="0:50.517">せ</span><span begin="0:50.517" end="0:51.031">暇</span><span begin="0:51.031" end="0:51.206">だ</span><span begin="0:51.206" end="0:51.685">し</span> <span begin="0:51.893" end="0:52.399">一</span><span begin="0:52.399" end="0:52.685">人</span><span begin="0:52.685" end="0:53.013">よ</span><span begin="0:53.013" end="0:53.305">り</span><span begin="0:53.305" end="0:53.521">ま</span><span begin="0:53.521" end="0:54.073">し</span></p><p begin="0:54.843" end="0:58.636" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.843" end="0:55.579">考</span><span begin="0:55.579" end="0:55.935">え</span><span begin="0:55.935" end="0:56.111">な</span><span begin="0:56.111" end="0:56.244">く</span><span begin="0:56.244" end="0:56.602">て</span><span begin="0:56.603" end="0:56.713">い</span><span begin="0:56.713" end="0:58.636">い</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="0:58.777" end="1:00.953" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.777"